{
  "slug": "buildkite",
  "name": "Buildkite",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official Buildkite skills for Claude Code, Cursor, and other AI coding agents — pipelines, migration, preflight, agent runtime, CLI, and API",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `buildkite-agent-runtime` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"add an annotation\", \"upload artifacts from a step\",…), `buildkite-api` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"call the Buildkite API\", \"use the REST API\",…), `buildkite-cli` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"trigger a build\", \"check build status\", \"watch a…), `buildkite-migration` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"migrate to Buildkite\", \"convert pipelines from Jenkins\", \"convert…), `buildkite-pipelines` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"write a pipeline\", \"add caching\", \"make this build…), `buildkite-preflight` (Runs Buildkite CI builds against changes in the local working tree)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install buildkite@claude-plugins-official` from `buildkite/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
